grpcxx provides a runtime-free C++26 gRPC client and server framework. Consumers need CMake >= 4.0 and vcpkg manifest mode with VCPKG_OVERLAY_PORTS set to $HOME/.local/vcpkg.

    find_package(grpcxx CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE grpcxx::grpcxx)

Individual modules are exported under the grpcxx:: namespace (for example grpcxx::core, grpcxx::h2, grpcxx::client, grpcxx::server, grpcxx::channel, grpcxx::streaming, grpcxx::compression, grpcxx::sync, and enabled codec targets).
Contract generation helpers are imported automatically via grpcxx_generate_contracts().
